                "text": "Small businesses are the backbones of our communities, but will face skyrocketing premiums because Congressional Republicans refuse to lower health care costs. I\u2019m working to find a bipartisan solution to reopen the government and protect health care. \n\nhttps://t.co/EOsA173U65",
